# In the Name of the Father (WotG 8) with the decouple module loaded and no Crystal War quest completed: Lion Springs
# plays 85; finished: the mission completes.
lists SouthernSanDoriaS/Lion_Springs/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/85
module modules/custom/lua/wotg_decouple_story_missions_from_nation_quests.lua
char zone=SouthernSanDoriaS pos=96,0,106 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg InTheNameOfTheFather current
login
trigger Lion_Springs                    # 85
finish                                  # completed
